  <Thumbnail>51ce61ac-4696-43b0-8295-aa1b7af039f3</Thumbnail>
  <History Date="16-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created" />
  <History Date="19-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Created from Varilite VLZ Wash" />
  <History Date="20-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Swapped Frame 2A/2B attribute ID's with 3A/3B in response to customer bug report." />
  <History Date="21-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised fixed colours and added reset int control function and macro in line with latest VLZ Spot charts (Wash charts currently unavailable)" />
  <History Date="21-06-17" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added Atlabase ID's." />
  <History Date="20-11-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Added product thumbnail.  Added channel counts to mode names.  Added colour index functions." />
  <History Date="20-11-19" Author="Nic Morris" Comment="Revised colour scroll functions in response to manufacturer feedback via Atlabase (charts are wrong)" />
